// A branch on a secret. riinac used to accept it, raising the security level
// of the branches; the Coq core's T_If requires a plain Benar. The REQ-111
// generator found the gap, and since 2026-10-23 riinac rejects the branch too
// (owner ruling): declassify a secret before branching on it.
fungsi utama() -> () kesan Bersih {
    biar hasil = kalau sulit betul { 1 } lain { 2 };
    ()
}
